{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51571","headline":"假僧榻闷吟 · 韦洵美","name":"假僧榻闷吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门壁纷纷蟋蟀声，背灯欹枕梦难成。\n人间有此不平事，何处人能报不平。\n（《万首唐人绝句》四十《鬼诗》）（「纷纷」，《灯下闲谈》作「忙忙」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦洵美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}